 #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/copy_chips.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ni[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ni/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plugin scaffold, grammar module, and conformance vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: create and register the bob-copy-chips plugin, then build the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pure parser, scanner, and serializer every surface shares, pinned by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON vectors and a round-trip property test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Inline chips in Live Preview and Reading view[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]inline[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inline: render copy chips as quiet pills in Live Preview and Reading [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]view, copy on click with in-place feedback, add the cursor-line copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command, and publish api.copyChips v1.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob-copy fence card[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fence[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inline[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fence: render bob-copy fences as titled cards with a header Copy button [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and byte-exact payloads, and teach chipAt and the cursor-line command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]about fences.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Copy card C row[/bold #D7AFFF]                                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]copycard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inline[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]copycard: add a C row to the Mod+Y Copy card in Bob Navigation Hotkeys [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that copies the chip at the cursor through api.copyChips.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make-or-edit card and Alt+Click edit[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]author[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fence[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]author: add the Mod+Shift+Y card that makes, converts, or edits a chip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a live preview, writing the result in one undo step, plus Alt+Click[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to edit.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault adoption, GTD prompt chips, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]after author, copycard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: add the gy Vim mapping, turn the GTD agent prompts into chips, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconcile with bob-cli-nh's new Summarize yesterday row, apply accepted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory decisions, and record follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ni","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ni.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-70b090c416ceeef9abf92d3659a9ad7a","started_at":"2026-11-19T15:07:42.674610+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"dc2a3eabdf1bab74239ab6e7184921c515598df52453c384c58857f23c933e16","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ni.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"194123d7ac2d15e1b6ef97476c6dfc3e28c4a820a8c15390c3ed5b0aea01a2